<title>JAPAN: Jusco files shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Jusco files shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jusco Co Ltd, a supermarket operator, said on Tuesday that it had applied to the Finance Ministry for a shelf registration to issue up to 100 billion yen worth of corporate bonds.</p>
<p>The registration will be effective for two years from May 31, 1997, it said.</p>
